# dense-same: Qwen3-8B DSpark dense drafter, 12 epochs

Branch `dense-same` (base: `spark-Qwen3-8B`). The dense DSpark drafter for `Qwen/Qwen3-8B`, trained with the
hyperparameters of the published Qwen3-8B dense DSpark run
([jiapingW/Qwen3-8b-dspark-SpecForge](https://huggingface.co/jiapingW/Qwen3-8b-dspark-SpecForge)) for 12 epochs
instead of 6. One continuous run: one W&B curve, one checkpoint per epoch, every epoch exported to
[yushengsu/dense-same](https://huggingface.co/yushengsu/dense-same) under `<k>ep/`.

| | |
|---|---|
| recipe | `examples/configs/online/disaggregated/external/qwen3-8b-dspark-dense-same-2node-h200.yaml` |
| launch | `scripts/launch/dense-same/` (`capture_node.sh`, `trainer_node.sh`, `watch_exports.sh`, `epoch_results.py`) |
| W&B | entity `eigent_radixark_training`, project `qwen3-8b-dspark`, run id `dense-same-r6` shown as `dense-same` (fixed id, `WANDB_RESUME=allow`; `dense-same`, `dense-same-causal`, `dense-same-r3`, `dense-same-r4` and `dense-same-r5` were abandoned attempts and W&B does not allow reusing a deleted id) |
| HF | `yushengsu/dense-same`, folders `1ep/` ... `12ep/` (servable HF export + tokenizer), README mirrors the table below |
| hardware | devbox `moe-16exp-1024dim` (h200-sci-k8s-1): rank 0 = 8x H200 capture servers, rank 1 = 8x H200 trainer |
| started | 2026-10-15 18:52 UTC (causal run; the 13:23 UTC bidirectional run was abandoned at step 4,050) |

